Subject: [PATCH] fix(entities): resolve and order Bedrock passenger links

Bedrock can include links with actor spawn packets or send links before the other actor is known. Retain those links until both entities exist, keep the rider first, and emit Java passenger updates when a link resolves or disappears. This avoids silently losing mounts during spawn ordering changes.
